40, col=1```\n`read` と `IFS` を駆使するといろいろできるなー","ts":"1626314759.389200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5pKy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16e009ac-8b33-447a-b4fb-5092b5d71e39","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"というかこれecho -n helloworldしたときに表示されなくて混乱してる","ts":"1626337755.399400","thread_ts":"1626337675.397900","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QGX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad5c685c-e911-4b91-b346-648a989f4e85","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`x` のあと、`.` が $COLUMNS - 1 個表示されて、次の行の先頭に `y` が表示されるのが期待値。","ts":"1626336325.392800","thread_ts":"1626336213.392700","parent_user_id":"U6XP9LZ6V","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c186"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1ac6b1e-ac4f-44ed-b4b9-a9cd9d7fd6b6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"bashとしてちょっとだけ改変したらこうなった\n```# shellcheck disable=SC2162,1117\noutput_newline() {\n  IFS='[;' read -s -d R -p $'\\033[6n' -a POS\n  [[ ${POS[2]} -gt 1 ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; echo -e \"\\e[7m%\\e[m\"\n}```\n• シェル関数は funciton と () を両方書くのはあまりおすすめではないらしい(ソース失念、あやふや)\n• bashなので `[[]]` にしている\n• readが-rしてないこと(SC2162)とechoのリテラルにあるバックスラッシュについて(SC1117)のHintをdisable\nこちらがいいというものではないですが...","ts":"1626345605.409700","thread_ts":"1626320817.389800","parent_user_id":"U03C6TEAZ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5h"}]}]
